[3.790607, "o", "est one small add\u001b[2;55Hitional assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[3;55H\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[5;55H  railmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[K\u001b[6;55H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[K\u001b[7;55H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAc\u001b[8;55Htion with render_history=True and\u001b[K\u001b[9;55H  forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[K\u001b[10;55H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overla\u001b[11;55Hy is painted client-side via surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[K\u001b[12;55H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux Whe\u001b[13;55HelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which is\u001b[K\u001b[14;55H  deliberately avoided.\u001b[K\u001b[15;55H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts age\u001b[16;55Hnt_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[K\u001b[17;55H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the\u001b[18;55H event.\u001b[K\u001b[19;55H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[35;55H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[36;55H──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[37;55H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n Railmux · Claude Code · ▣                                                                                                                                 \u001b[38;5;231m→ new session in railmux\u001b[30m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[37;107H"]
